        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "39-9-4 The hearing shall be conducted informally. The hearing officer shall have the authority to make appropriate procedural rules. If either party requests, the hearing shall be in a closed session. The teacher may represent himself/herself or be represented by the Association.",
