        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "39-9-5 The hearing shall be limited to those grounds specified in the request for a hearing and supported by such proof as is offered, provided a hearing officer may consider additional arguments and facts as specified in Section 39-9-2. A decision shall be made within fifteen (15) days following completion of the hearing.",
